<% layout("/layouts/boilerplate.ejs") -%>

<div class="row mt-5 mb-5">
    <div class="col-12 col-sm-10 col-md-8 col-lg-8 col-xl-7 mx-auto">

        <h1 class="mb-4">🛡️ Privacy Policy</h1>

        <p class="text-muted">Last Updated: November 2026</p>

        <hr>

        <p>
            Wanderlust is a student project developed for educational,
            demonstration, and evaluation purposes.
        </p>

        <div class="mb-4">
            <h4>1. Information We Collect</h4>
            <p>
                When you create an account, the application may collect
                information such as your username and email address.
                Information related to listings, reviews, and other activities
                may also be stored to provide the application's functionality.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-4">
            <h4>2. How We Use Your Information</h4>
            <p>
                The information collected is used to provide features such as
                user authentication, listing management, reviews, and other
                functionality available within the application.
            </p>

            <p>
                Passwords are stored using secure hashing mechanisms and are
                not stored as plain-text passwords.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-4">
            <h4>3. Data Storage</h4>
            <p>
                Application data may be stored using third-party services such
                as MongoDB Atlas for database storage and Cloudinary for image
                hosting.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-4">
            <h4>4. Cookies and Sessions</h4>
            <p>
                Wanderlust uses cookies and server-side sessions to maintain
                login sessions and provide authenticated features.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-4">
            <h4>5. Data Security</h4>
            <p>
                Reasonable measures are used within the application to protect
                user account information. However, as this is a student project,
                the application should not be considered a production-grade
                system for storing highly sensitive or confidential information.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-4">
            <h4>6. Educational Purpose</h4>
            <p>
                Wanderlust is developed as a student project and is intended
                primarily for educational, demonstration, and evaluation purposes.
            </p>
        </div>

        <a href="/listings" class="btn btn-dark mt-3">
            Back to Wanderlust
        </a>

    </div>
</div>